 What it takes to launch a career as a satellite technician 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Dezmond started in an Amazon fulfillment center. Since starting, he has earned a satellite technician certificate. What did it take? Just one of Amazon’s free skills training programs.


 The impact: Now Dezmond works for Amazon Leo, helping launch satellites.


