 What it takes to turn a childhood interest in space into a career 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Dezmond grew up fascinated with space. He turned that interest into a career with Amazon. What did it take? Just one of Amazon’s free skills training programs.


 Even better: “Amazon covered my tuition,” Dezmond said.


